---
description: >-
  Association and include/extend edges whose labels deliberately echo the
  relationship-keyword vocabulary ("include account details", "extend
  active session") on plain `--` associations, checking that label text
  is never mistaken for the `include`/`extend` keyword syntax.
---
usecase-beta
    direction LR

    actor User
    Login("Sign in")
    Checkout("Checkout")
    Payment("Process payment")
    Discount("Apply discount")

    User -- "include account details" --> Login
    Login -- "extend active session" --> Checkout
    Checkout ..> : include Payment
    Discount ..> : extend Checkout
